          "end": 236.22,
          "en": "but images that are slightly smaller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.22,
          "end": 238.87,
          "en": "Because of course we got higher resolution cameras",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.87,
          "end": 241.31,
          "en": "on modern devices and therefore images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.31,
          "end": 245.77,
          "en": "if you don't restrict the quality can become really large.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 245.77,
          "end": 248.48,
          "en": "Sometimes you want that, in this app we don't need it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 248.48,
          "end": 250.633,
          "en": "hence I will lower the quality.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.97,
          "end": 253.75,
          "en": "Now definitely feel free to have a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.75,
          "end": 255.71,
          "en": "at the other options here as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.71,
          "end": 259.113,
          "en": "but for me, this is the option that I wanna go with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
