          "en": "we can see this object which describes the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 337.44,
          "end": 340.22,
          "en": "For example, we got uri property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 340.22,
          "end": 342.27,
          "en": "which holds the path to the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 342.27,
          "end": 345.28,
          "en": "So that's the actual path on our device",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 345.28,
          "end": 347.36,
          "en": "or in this case on the ambulator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
