          "en": "where the taken photo was stored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 350.65999999999997,
          "end": 354.853,
          "en": "So, that's all nice, but why didn't it work on iOS?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
